OL,3,GNEWSAFlats plan for aparthotel after
OL,4,Abusiness changes
OL,5,
OL,6,FA decline in the number of business
OL,7,Ftravellers to Reading town centre means
OL,8,Fan aparthotel is "no longer
OL,9,Fcommercially sustainable" and should be
OL,10,Fturned into flats, its owner has said.
OL,12,FCity Wall House in West Street has 31
OL,13,Fapartments but TA Fisher Ltd said the
OL,14,F"substantial change in the business
OL,15,Fworld" after Brexit and the Covid
OL,16,Fpandemic meant they were used less.
