OL,3,GNEWSAFlats plan for aparthotel after
OL,4,Abusiness changes
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt has applied to change the
OL,7,Fclassification of the building to
OL,8,Fresidential accommodation, which the
OL,9,Fcompany said would help to provide
OL,10,Fhousing "at the lower end of the
OL,11,Fhousing market".
OL,13,FReading Borough Council will decide the
OL,14,Fapplication in due course.
